<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED THIRD DAY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN COLLATED THIRD DAY RESULTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>MELBOURNE, Jan 15 (Reuter) Collated results on the third day</p>
<p>of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, second round</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) 3-6 6-0 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Dennis Van Scheppingen (Netherlands) beat Eyal Ran (Israel)</p>
<p>6-2 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-3 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Karsten Braasch (Germany) beat 12-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-0 6-2</p>
<p>7-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 6-0 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-3 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>14-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-4 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 15-Michael Stich (Germany) 4-6</p>
<p>6-1 6-2 4-6 9-7</p>
<p>Women's singles, second round</p>
<p>16-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Wiltrud Probst (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-0 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>7-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Flora Perfetti (Italy) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) beat Natalia Medvedeva (Ukraine) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Marketa Kochta (Germany) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 6-0</p>
<p>4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina) beat Gigi Fernandez (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Rika Hiraki (Japan) beat 10-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 0-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) beat Jane Taylor (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
